ive range of insurance options, ensuring vital coverage for their property, life, and potential critical illnesses.</in-capmkt:ReasonsForActionOfGrantingOrWithdrawalOrSurrenderOrCancellationOrSuspensionOfKeyLicensesOrRegulatoryApprovals><in-capmkt:EstimatedImpactOfKeyLicenseOrRegulatoryApprovalOnListedEntity contextRef="MainI">Otherwise - to offer its customers a comprehensive range of insurance options, ensuring vital coverage for their property, life, and potential critical illnesses.</in-capmkt:EstimatedImpactOfKeyLicenseOrRegulatoryApprovalOnListedEntity><in-capmkt:PeriodOfKeyLicenseOrRegulatoryApproval contextRef="MainI">Renewed w.e.f. December 01,2026 and shall remain in force, subject to payment of annual fee, unless suspended or cancelled by the Authority.</in-capmkt:PeriodOfKeyLicenseOrRegulatoryApproval><in-capmkt:ActualImpactOfKeyLicenseOrRegulatoryApprovalOnListedEntity contextRef="MainI">NA</in-capmkt:ActualImpactOfKeyLicenseOrRegulatoryApprovalOnListedEntity><in-capmkt:CorrectiveActionsTakenByTheListedEntityPursuantToTheWithdrawalOrSurrenderOrCancellationOrSuspensionOfKeyLicensesOrRegulatoryApprovals contextRef="MainI">NA</in-capmkt:CorrectiveActionsTakenByTheListedEntityPursuantToTheWithdrawalOrSurrenderOrCancellationOrSuspensionOfKeyLicensesOrRegulatoryApprovals></xbrli:xbrl>
